### Event API Tests

### Create an event (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:8080/events
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token=<token_from_login>

{
  "name": "Summer Music Festival",
  "description": "An amazing outdoor music festival featuring top artists",
  "date": "2024-07-15T18:00:00",
  "totalTickets": 1000
}

###

### List all events (public)
GET http://localhost:8080/events

###

### Get specific event by ID (public)
GET http://localhost:8080/events/1
